{"step_index":135,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T12:04:49Z","input_tokens":5533,"cache_read_tokens":175780,"output_tokens":857,"thinking":"Considering a user refresh of the browser before server restart. The existing server instance would still be serving from the root directory. This scenario might introduce unexpected behavior due to the active server's state.\n\n\nIf `index.html` in the root is updated to load assets from `app_build/`, a server restart will directly serve the upgraded build. However, a refresh *before* restart could serve stale content. The solution is syncing root assets (HTML, CSS, JS) with `app_build/` and having root `engine.py` / `explainer.py` re-export from the `app_build` counterparts. This ensures the same upgraded application is served regardless of server restart. Updating `engine.py`, `explainer.py` to re-export and syncing the root files is the correct approach.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"\"\"\nRoot compatibility shim — forwards to `app_build.engine`.\nAll core application source code is isolated in `app_build/`.\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom app_build.engine import (  # noqa: F401\n    FORBIDDEN_CALLS,\n     MemoryHeapTracker,\n    SUPPORTED_BUILTINS,\n    UNSUPPORTED_AST_NODES,\n    format_py_val,\n    get_py_type,\n    trace_python_program,\n    validate_python_support,\n)\n","Description":"Update root engine.py to forward to app_build.engine","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\engine.py","toolAction":"Forwarding root engine.py to app_build.engine","toolSummary":"Forward root engine.py to app_build.engine"}},{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"\"\"\nRoot compatibility shim — forwards to `app_build.explainer`.\nAll core application source code is isolated in `app_build/`.\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom app_build.explainer import (  # noqa: F401\n    PYTHON_SYMBOL_DICTIONARY,\n    explain_symbols_in_line,\n    generate_step_explanation,\n)\n","Description":"Update root explainer.py to forward to app_build.explainer","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\explainer.py","toolAction":"Forwarding root explainer.py to app_build.explainer","toolSummary":"Forward root explainer.py to app_build.explainer"}}]}
